  "description": "APPLICATION FOR VARIATION OF CONDITION 2 (APPROVED PLANS), ATTACHED TO LBM PLANNING APPLICATION 24/1323 RELATING TO THE RESTORATION, ALTERATION AND EXTENSIONS TO THE EXISTING LISTED HOUSE AND COACH HOUSE BUILDINGS. INCLUDING THE DEMOLITION AND REBUILDING OF THE REAR CENTRAL AND EASTERN EXTENSIONS, THE FORMATION OF A NEW FORECOURT GARAGE AND ARTISTS STUDIO BUILDINGS AND A BASEMENT POOL/SPA EXTENSION BELOW THE REAR GARDEN. WITH ASSOCIATED RE-LANDSCAPING OF FRONT AND REAR GARDENS AND REBUILDING OF THE FRONT BOUNDARY WALL, REINSTATING PEDESTRIAN GATES, GATE POSTS AND WIDENED VEHICULAR GATES. CHANGES INCLUDE THE REPOSITIONING OF THE STAIR CORE AND REAR CHAPEL EXTENSION, AN INCREASE IN MASSING OF THE REAR CHAPEL EXTENSION AT LOWER GROUND, UPPER GROUND, 1ST AND 2ND FLOOR LEVEL, A RAISED TERRACE AT THE REAR, THE ADDITION OF A CHIMNEY TO THE SE SIDE ELEVATION AND OTHER INTERNAL ALTERATIONS.",
